# By default the app uses same-origin `/api` requests, which is the correct production setup.
# In local Vite dev, `/api` is proxied to `http://127.0.0.1:8787`.
# Leave this unset in Vercel production so rewrites can proxy `/api/*` safely.
# Uncomment the localhost line only if you want the browser to bypass Vite proxy and call the local API directly.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
# Uncomment one of the tunnel lines only if you intentionally want the browser to call the tunnel directly.
# Uncomment one of the lines below only if you intentionally want the browser to call the tunnel directly.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://cz9c2qnq-8787.asse.devtunnels.ms
